<section class="hero">
  <h1>Backcountry Recipe Cards</h1>
  <p class="lead">Printable recipes for your next high adventure trip.</p>
</section>

<section class="overview">
  <h2>Breakfast</h2>

  <div class="recipe-card">
    <h3>🥣 Mountain Oatmeal</h3>
    <p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Oatmeal, powdered milk, brown sugar, cinnamon, dried fruit</p>
    <p><strong>Instructions:</strong> Bring water to boil, add oatmeal, cook 5 min. Stir in milk powder, sugar, and fruit.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="recipe-card">
    <h3>🍳 Freeze-Dried Eggs Scramble</h3>
    <p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Freeze-dried eggs, instant potatoes, cheese, salsa</p>
    <p><strong>Instructions:</strong> Rehydrate eggs with hot water, mix with prepared potatoes, top with cheese and salsa.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="recipe-card">
    <h3>🥞 Pancakes (Mountain Style)</h3>
    <p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Pancake mix, powdered eggs, milk, honey</p>
    <p><strong>Instructions:</strong> Mix all ingredients with water. Cook on medium-low flame. Drizzle with honey.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="overview">
  <h2>Lunch & Snacks</h2>

  <div class="recipe-card">
    <h3>🥪 Trail Wraps</h3>
    <p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Tortillas, pepperoni, cheese, peanut butter, honey, trail mix</p>
    <p><strong>Instructions:</strong> Lay out tortillas, layer ingredients, roll up. No cooking needed!</p>
  </div>

  <div class="recipe-card">
    <h3>🍫 Energy Balls</h3>
    <p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Oatmeal, peanut butter, honey, chocolate chips, chia seeds</p>
    <p><strong>Instructions:</strong> Mix all ingredients in a bag. Roll into balls. No cooking required!</p>
  </div>

  <div class="recipe-card">
    <h3>🥨 GORP (Good Old Raisins & Peanuts)</h3>
    <p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Trail mix, granola, dried fruit, nuts, chocolate chips</p>
    <p><strong>Instructions:</strong> Mix together. Pack in snack-sized bags for easy access.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="overview">
  <h2>Dinner</h2>

  <div class="recipe-card">
    <h3>🍝 Instant Pasta</h3>
    <p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Instant pasta packets, olive oil, parmesan cheese, summer sausage</p>
    <p><strong>Instructions:</strong> Boil water, cook pasta, add olive oil and cheese. Slice sausage to add protein.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="recipe-card">
    <h3>🍲 Dehydrated Stew</h3>
    <p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Freeze-dried stew, hot water, bread</p>
    <p><strong>Instructions:</strong> Rehydrate with boiling water, wait 10 minutes. Eat with bread.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="recipe-card">
    <h3>🌮 Backcountry Tacos</h3>
    <p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Tortillas, taco seasoning, refried beans, cheese, hot sauce</p>
    <p><strong>Instructions:</strong> Warm beans with seasoning, spoon onto tortillas, add cheese and hot sauce.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="overview">
  <h2>Drinks</h2>

  <div class="recipe-card">
    <h3>☕ Cocoa</h3>
    <p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Hot cocoa mix, powdered milk, marshmallows</p>
    <p><strong>Instructions:</strong> Mix cocoa and milk powder with hot water. Top with marshmallows.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="recipe-card">
    <h3>🍵 Trail Tea</h3>
    <p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Tea bags, honey, lemon powder</p>
    <p><strong>Instructions:</strong> Steep tea in hot water. Add honey and lemon to taste.</p>
  </div>
</section>

